---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ENTITY_STATEMENT } from '../data/site.js';
---

<Base
  title="Now"
  path="/now"
  description={`${ENTITY_STATEMENT} What he is working on right now, updated quarterly.`}
>
  <h1>Now</h1>
  <p class="kicker">Updated August 4, 2026. This page gets a fresh pass at least quarterly.</p>

  <h2>What I'm working on</h2>
  <p>
    Guardian, Deep Media's agent layer. We're building autonomous AI agents that investigate fraud,
    disinformation, and other digital harms across the surface, deep, and dark web, and package what
    they find as audit-ready intelligence. The design problem I care most about right now is keeping
    a human at the helm: agents that compress weeks of investigation into hours without ever asking
    anyone to trust an unexplained verdict.
  </p>

  <h2>What I'm writing and thinking about</h2>
  <p>
    AI-enabled social engineering, and why the human firewall keeps failing. The gap between what
    detection can honestly claim and what buyers want to hear. Permaculture ethics applied to
    digital spaces.
  </p>

  <h2>Where to find me next</h2>
  <p>
    IAFCI International Training Conference, Grand Hyatt Nashville, August 25, 2026. I'm presenting
    "AI: both the cause and solution for all fraud fighters" at 2:00pm.
  </p>

  <p>
    Want to compare notes on any of this? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
